# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/ptydriver

## Purpose
Provides pseudo-terminal driver integration used by daemon features that supervise interactive or terminal-oriented subprocesses.

## Contents
Contains Go adapters around PTY/process lifecycle operations and platform-specific implementation details where required.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by daemon integration/workflow code and depends on process, terminal, and operating-system facilities.

## Invariants
Started processes and PTY handles have explicit ownership, cancellation/close releases resources, I/O errors remain observable, and platform-specific behavior stays behind this integration boundary.